{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此即序"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "陳舜俞撰"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "并序共四篇"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "并序共二十六篇"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "并序共一十三篇"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "五篇"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "共四十篇"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "論原畢"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "六篇"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "六篇"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "共十三封"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "四封"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "別幅"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "次幅"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "共二十三篇"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "與祖圖上進"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "共一十二篇"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "七篇"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "共十二篇"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "并敘"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "共六十首"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "共六十九首"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三十一韻"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一百韻又引"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "并引"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二首"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "并敘"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "石刻本在杭靈隱山"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "已上之事見於劉煦唐書及本朝所撰高僧傳"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "梁武齊文宣也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "魏武周武"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "敬或作警"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "或無上二而字"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "本或無之"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "稱經者。自後人尊其法。而非六祖之意也。今從其舊不敢改易。亦可謂經則論\n在其本經下卷之末"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "六祖諡號大鑒禪師"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即四依也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一作君子"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "測或作無"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "夫或作大或作性"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一本作正"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "極或作及"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一本無所"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "聖人或作君子"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "政或作正"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "枉或作奇"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "上二句似文倒"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "裁或作材"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "仁或作人"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "或作擅字。依荀子文也。此乃專擅意也。在理當作擅。與禪契"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "或無者字"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "用或作則或無固字"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "忘或司字"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此脫地名二字"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "脫名"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "散疑筆誤宜作助兼"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "或無草木二字"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "或無地字"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "疑有作發"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "或無詞上文字"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "或作察察"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "利有作市"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "或無政字"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "實或作真"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "或作利字"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "其或作吾"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "六篇"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "或云春秋六經"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "本或從辯"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "或作人心"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "或從辯"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "隋大\n業間。劉文靜坐與李密連姻繫獄。太宗入視。乃謂曰。今看卿非兒女情與卿圖大事也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "高祖初起義師西圖\n中國。隋將宋老生據霍邑以據義師。會久雨糧盡。高祖議還太原。太宗欲須入咸陽高祖不納。號泣聲聞帳中"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "武德九年。建成元吉謀害太宗。事泄。太宗將\n尉遲敬德等九人。入玄武門。誅於臨朝殿前"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "太宗登極初。可汗寇涇州。總兵百萬至渭水便橋。太宗獨上以輕曜軍\n容。可汗見懼而請和。故刑白馬盟於便橋上而去"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "正觀初。奏秦王破陣樂曲。封德彛對曰。陛下以聖武戡亂。玄極奏樂象德定。文容\n以為比。上曰。朕雖以武功定天下。終以文德綏海內文。武之道名隨其時。公謂文容不如蹈厲。斯言過矣"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "正觀初突厥諸部叛討之而兵叛。群臣請乘便討之上曰。豈有新與\n之和乘其亂而滅之邪。從部落盡叛。六畜皆死。朕終不討。待其有罪而後擒取"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "太宗謂群臣曰。赦有罪乃不軌輩。古語一歲再赦。好人喑啞故朕不頻\n赦。庶得四海安泰也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "太宗初奏新樂。謂侍臣\n曰。禮樂之作。聖人緣物設教。以為撙節。治之隆替皆由於此。史大夫杜淹曰。前代存亡實由於樂。故\n陳之亡為王樹後庭。齊之亡為伴侶行路。聞之莫不悲泣。上曰。不然夫音樂之感人心。歡者聞之則悅。憂\n者聽之則悲。將亡之國其民心苦。苦心所感聞樂則悲。何有樂聲使人悅者。悲乎。今玉樹伴侶其音具在。今公\n\n奏之公則不悲耳"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "正觀初。藉田方\n田給侍。中孔頴達曰。按禮。天子於南郊。諸侯於東郊。晉武於東南。今於城東不合古禮。上曰。禮緣人情。\n亦何有定。虞書云。平秩東作。朕今見少陽之地。田於東郊。蓋其儀也。亦何不合於古禮者哉"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "群臣以宮中卑濕請營一閣以居。上曰朕德慚漢文。\n豈可過勞民力。竟不許"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "正觀四年冬。斷刑\n四十九人。幾致刑厝嶺外之戶不閉行旅不賫糧也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "正觀七年冬。親錄囚死者三百九十人。令明年秋來就刑。至\n是畢集。而詔以原之"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "太宗納魏\n徵諫爭。見於本傳甚眾"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "太宗文中子曰。如有用我者。吾則抱周禮\n以從之"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "爻或作義"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "爻或作義"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "六篇"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "或作技成"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "評漫之時"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "止或作沮"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "妙法華經"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "有本云龍亦有妄鳴乎"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "蓋師少時所稱而後更號寂子"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "或云欲人正心以行其教"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "前後四書"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "或無達道二字"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此繫東歸後復致此書也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "傳或寄字"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此書繫次富相後再致之書也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "或云以言忤物"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "別副"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "次副"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "或云勤勤"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "回答"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "與圖上進"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此郎侍郎作附"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "或名宗原"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音浴"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "亦謂潯州"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "鷰乃余卿"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "執文儒者習理\n釋者。習以俗語以諭其法此姚公來書云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "寶花琦果南人舊稱"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "或作寥寥"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "在郡之西"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "俗謂駝宛乃語訛也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "亦謂西庵"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "俗謂鷄籠乃語訛也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "亦謂之暖泉也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "南人謂谷為塢谷音浴也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "缺一名"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "或無南字"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "正字避廟諱"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "或無極深且三字"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "名或作志"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "或闕此四字"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "并敘"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "與周禮湧道異義也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "并敘"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "或云逍遙乎至靜"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "元集中不著名可疑也今\n謂高識者乃寓意耳"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "并敘"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "倰或從凌"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "并敘"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "或作極字"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "凡其詩偈並見於文集。此皆略不書"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "法華維摩涅槃金光明經"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "謂謝絕徒屬賓友筆硯也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "云云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "并敘"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "并序"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "并敘"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "并序"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "遂或召字"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "并序"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一作惠遠"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "梵音舍利此云身骨"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "今寺之舊名"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "附"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "亦曰投地碎身顧其開示"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "亦云不可憑。亦云不在詳評。然各有旨也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "并敘"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "昧或作衰"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "或無小字"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "或本無聖人字"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "或止一章字也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "上或無之字"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "或云六藝"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "殺或救字"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "略或作掠"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "已上皆退之文"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此說見太玄解義"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "如辨佛骨事也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "注韓子為進學解。謂其陽斥佛老矣故其作原道最在前"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "避後諱"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "知或之字"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一作慟字"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "注詹之所以死者亦見於太平廣記"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一本止略引司馬遷范曄左丘明等三人"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "并敘"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "修或揮字"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "時周感之同來"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "五首"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "凌虛或作扶搖"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "九首"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "駐目或作獨往"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "俗謂水鳥啼則天下雨焉"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "因事"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "蟠"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "契嵩"}
