{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "君去年有苦笋上批把熟之句"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "契嵩"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "契嵩"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "蟠"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "惟晤"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "契嵩"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "契嵩"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "蟠"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "惟晤"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "契嵩"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "間公濟與冲晦遊。斷此葷酒。多隨其奉戒"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "契嵩"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "蟠"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "辯元"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "惟晤"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "蟠"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "契嵩"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "投或作心"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "契嵩"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "蟠"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "惟晤"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "嵩"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "蟠"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "仲靈文章大手。非特休比。此比以詩言耳"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "契嵩"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即僧也者"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "謂以儒而嫉佛"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "今既以陳令舉所著之記為前敘舊得一敘。不書名。不知何人所作。或云。瑩道溫觀其　文藻美麗。或近\n似之他輩不能為也。而中間敘其為文之所以。而不甚流類。不免隨為。葺正之。仍舊綴于集末云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三十乙韻"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "并引"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "謂儒釋二教雖殊皆\n相資而化物也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "略去五韻"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即師里名。彼多獮猛陵男子故"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "略去二韻"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "略去七韻"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "師臨終偈云。不似大梅老。貪隨鼯鼠聲。云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "略去二韻"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "略去三韻"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "略去六韻"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "師有遊吾湟川燕嘉亭。及楞伽山寺記也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "國或作異"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "命研味其詩。雖風調氣韻高爽酋勁。而中間凡用事綴韻過于迂辟。今略取其辭意簡雅超邁之\n句。次成七十三韻。亦可見其才志向慕之誠至焉"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "并敘"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "中間敘繁處。皆略之"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二首"}
